{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MpknMJJ42nFZYngKKhBDZr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 表现评估 / Performance Assessment (PA)\n2\t\n3\t**WIM 编码：** MP-031-3:2016-C01/PA(BIRU MUDA)\n4\t**NOSS：** MP-031-3:2016 推拿疗法服务 (Level 3)\n5\t**CU：** C01 推拿疗法服务咨询\n6\t**纸张颜色：** 浅蓝\n7\t**时数：** 4 小时（含 30 分钟资料审阅 + 3 小时实操 + 30 分钟反馈）\n8\t**最后更新：** 2026-04-17\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t## 评估说明\n12\t\n13\t- 综合实操评估，覆盖 C01 全部 4 项工作活动\n14\t- 学员一对一面对模拟客户（持牌评估员或角色扮演者）\n15\t- 全程录像作为 PB 与 PPD 复核证据\n16\t- 满分 100 分，及格 ≥ 70 分\n17\t- 不及格者可补考一次\n18\t\n19\t## 评估对象\n20\t\n21\t- 已完成 PM-teori、PM-amali、KK-01 至 KK-04、KA 的学员\n22\t\n23\t## 评估场地与设备\n24\t\n25\t| 项目 | 说明 |\n26\t|------|------|\n27\t| 模拟咨询室 | 符合 KP-01 §1 标准 |\n28\t| 模拟客户 | 持牌评估员 / 角色扮演者 |\n29\t| 客户档案夹（空白） | 1 |\n30\t| 信息表 / 同意书 / 转介表 | 各 2 |\n31\t| 解剖图、经络模型 | 各 1 |\n32\t| VAS、温度计、噪音计 | 各 1 |\n33\t| 录像设备 | 1 套 |\n34\t\n35\t## 评估任务\n36\t\n37\t学员须于 3 小时内独立完成以下完整流程：\n38\t\n39\t### 任务 1：咨询区准备（15 分钟）\n40\t按 KK-01 检查并设置咨询区。\n41\t\n42\t### 任务 2：客户接待与登记（30 分钟）\n43\t- 礼貌迎接\n44\t- 信息收集\n45\t- 身份核实\n46\t- 客户记录建立\n47\t\n48\t### 任务 3：客户咨询与四诊（45 分钟）\n49\t- 期望访谈\n50\t- 健康史采集"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c637cc40-8152-404a-aa5d-36736366ea90","uuid":"ade2bf24-fa0c-406d-b55f-9d5f4b1ba3c3","timestamp":"2026-04-17T09:34:58.694Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Jyue/Documents/1-projects/noss-to-wim/tuinalogy-services/C01/PA.md","content":"# 表现评估 / Performance Assessment (PA)\n\n**WIM 编码：** MP-031-3:2016-C01/PA(BIRU MUDA)\n**NOSS：** MP-031-3:2016 推拿疗法服务 (Level 3)\n**CU：** C01 推拿疗法服务咨询\n**纸张颜色：** 浅蓝\n**时数：** 4 小时（含 30 分钟资料审阅 + 3 小时实操 + 30 分钟反馈）\n**最后更新：** 2026-04-17\n---\n\n## 评估说明\n\n- 综合实操评估，覆盖 C01 全部 4 项工作活动\n- 学员一对一面对模拟客户（持牌评估员或角色扮演者）\n- 全程录像作为 PB 与 PPD 复核证据\n- 满分 100 分，及格 ≥ 70 分\n- 不及格者可补考一次\n\n## 评估对象\n\n- 已完成 PM-teori、PM-amali、KK-01 至 KK-04、KA 的学员\n\n## 评估场地与设备\n\n| 项目 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 模拟咨询室 | 符合 KP-01 §1 标准 |\n| 模拟客户 | 持牌评估员 / 角色扮演者 |\n| 客户档案夹（空白） | 1 |\n| 信息表 / 同意书 / 转介表 | 各 2 |\n| 解剖图、经络模型 | 各 1 |\n| VAS、温度计、噪音计 | 各 1 |\n| 录像设备 | 1 套 |\n\n## 评估任务\n\n学员须于 3 小时内独立完成以下完整流程：\n\n### 任务 1：咨询区准备（15 分钟）\n按 KK-01 检查并设置咨询区。\n\n### 任务 2：客户接待与登记（30 分钟）\n- 礼貌迎接\n- 信息收集\n- 身份核实\n- 客户记录建立\n\n### 任务 3：客户咨询与四诊（45 分钟）\n- 期望访谈\n- 健康史采集","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":224}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011k7sRr5z5e6sNRrR3V44hk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the tuinalogy PA uses \"### 任务 N：\" (Task N:) format rather than \"## TASK N:\" in English. Let me handle both:\n- English: `## TASK \\d+`\n- Chinese: `### 任务 \\d+：` or `### 任务 \\d+`\n\nLet me now write the implementation. I'll write both files.\n\nOne more thing - for line counting I need to be careful. Let me aim for compact but readable code.\n\nFor `_tools/assessment-time-validator.py`:\n\n\n- Target ~100 lines\n\nFor `tests/test_assessment_timing.py`:\n- Target ~120 lines\n\nLet me write the final implementation now. I'll be careful with the regex patterns and make it robust.\n\nFor section detection in KA files:\n- English: \"SECTION A\", \"SECTION B\", \"SECTION C\"\n- Chinese: \"选择题\", \"填空题\", \"简答题\", \"案例题\", \"综合\"\n\nFor question counting in KA files:\n- English MCQ: `**A\\d+.`\n- English short answer: `**B\\d+.`\n- English scenario: `**C\\d+.`\n- Chinese numbered\n\nWriting the validator implementation... I'm looking at the line counts for the test file and realizing the combined total pushes past the budget, so I need to trim both the tool and tests down to around 100 lines each to stay within the ~350 line limit for the diff.\n\nWriting the assessment validator tool... Writing the assessment parser... Continuing to parse different question formats—English bold-formatted questions, Chinese numbered items, and sub-questions within scenario sections—then calculating total time by multiplying question counts against time weights for each type. Now I'm setting up a function to scan all assessment files in the project directory, iterating through KA and PA document types with their respective limits. Generating the CSV report... Writing the test file... I'm setting up the test file by importing the necessary modules and loading the assessment validator tool dynamically. Now I'm defining sample assessment files to use in the tests—starting with a knowledge assessment that includes multiple choice questions, short answer questions, and scenario questions with a marking scheme, followed by a performance assessment template.\n\nWriting test cases... Writing test cases... Writing test assertions... Writing test methods...\n\nI'm checking that the CSV file gets created, contains the expected data fields, and includes the percentage and time estimate columns. The test file comes to about 155 lines, which combined with the module code brings the total to around 250 lines—well under the 350-line budget even accounting for formatting expansion.\n\nNow I need to implement the actual code, starting with the `estimate_question_time` function that auto-detects question types using regex patterns. The totals check out—KA comes to 25 minutes and PA to 30 minutes. But I'm noticing a type annotation issue: the function returns `dict[str, object]`, which means mypy will complain when the test accesses nested values like `result[\"counts\"][\"mcq\"]` since the inner dictionary is typed as `object`.\n\nI should check if mypy runs in this project's pre-commit hooks, but to be safe, I'll use a more specific return type annotation that properly reflects the nested dictionary structure, and make sure all test methods have explicit `-> None` return types as the progress notes require. Using `dict[str, Any]` means the nested access will work at runtime even though the type checker sees it as `Any`, which is fine for the test code. I'll follow the same pattern as the existing test file and add `-> None` annotations to all test methods, then finalize the implementation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3462,"cache_read_input_tokens":49405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3462},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","infere